    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.comment\n\n### Description\n\nNeovim 0.9 will have capabilites which enable getting 'commentstring' option respecting tree-sitter injections (neovim/neovim#22643 and neovim/neovim#22634). Figure out a way to use them in order for users to not rely on [JoosepAlviste/nvim-ts-context-commentstring](https://github.com/JoosepAlviste/nvim-ts-context-commentstring).",
    "closed_at": "2023-05-12T09:06:26Z",
