        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Actually, you don't need to: you just need to deal with the fact that some (injected) parsers don't have a filetype assigned, which means you need to find the commentstring for the _injecting_ parser.\r\n\r\n(Also applies to `comment` and `luadoc` parsers in case you try to _uncomment_ something.)",
            "created_at": "2023-03-30T14:38:57Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/287#issuecomment-1490424240",
